/** @mainpage ClickFunnelsDataProvider Module

    @tableofcontents

    @section clickfunnelsdataproviderintro ClickFunnelsDataProvider Introduction

    The %ClickFunnelsDataProvider module provides a data provider API for the ClickFunnels 2.0
    marketing and sales funnel platform.

    To use this module, use \c "%requires ClickFunnelsDataProvider" in your code.

    All the public symbols in the module are defined in the ClickFunnelsDataProvider namespace.

    The main classes are:
    - @ref ClickFunnelsDataProvider::ClickFunnelsDataProvider "ClickFunnelsDataProvider":
      the root data provider for ClickFunnels
    - @ref ClickFunnelsDataProvider::ClickFunnelsDataProviderFactory "ClickFunnelsDataProviderFactory":
      the data provider factory for ClickFunnels

    @section clickfunnelsdataproviderrelnotes Release Notes

    @subsection clickfunnelsdataproviderv1_0 ClickFunnelsDataProvider v1.0
    - the initial version of the %ClickFunnelsDataProvider module
*/

#! Contains all public definitions in the ClickFunnelsDataProvider module
public namespace ClickFunnelsDataProvider {
}
